@comment{
  Pulse Reliability Atlas -- BibTeX references for the npj Digital
  Medicine submission package (preprint_npj/paper.tex).

  Source of record: this file is a working copy of
  preprint/references.bib, kept in lock-step with the monograph's
  bibliography but maintained separately because the npj submission
  uses native bibtex (which requires @comment{} syntax) whereas the
  monograph uses pandoc --citeproc (which accepts % comments).

  Citation keys are author-lastname + year (e.g. morris1991,
  webb2022vent). Each entry has a DOI or PMID anchor verified during
  the S010 literature-review pass.

  Pruning of unused entries is deferred to Step 8 of the S028
  splitting work per the approved blueprint; the file currently
  carries every entry from preprint/references.bib byte-for-byte.
}

